WEBVTT

00:00:29.145 --> 00:00:31.061
Can you tell me more about them?"

00:00:31.593 --> 00:00:33.237
It always works,

00:00:33.261 --> 00:00:35.447
and we have a good laugh about it too.

00:00:36.164 --> 00:00:40.656
In reality, our capital city,
Ulaanbaatar, is very urban.

00:00:41.267 --> 00:00:42.681
We have commercial buildings,

00:00:42.705 --> 00:00:43.877
brand-name hotels

00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:45.773
and beautiful art spaces too.

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:48.536
But all too often

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:52.352
foreigners fixate on what Mongolia lacks.

00:00:53.006 --> 00:00:55.853
They look at our massive,
untouched landscape,

00:00:55.877 --> 00:00:58.195
traditional nomadic lifestyles,

00:00:58.219 --> 00:01:00.987
and see it as a sign of poverty.